### THIN_ACCOUNT_0 — author has 0–1 total reviews

> "Great place, loved it!" — 1 review total on Google Maps
> "Amazing, 5 stars!" — 0 reviews, account created recently
> "Very good service." — 1 review, no profile photo, no history
> "Полностью доволен. Рекомендую." — 0 reviews total, single visit account
> "Everything was exactly as expected, will return." — 1 review total, nothing else on the profile

