### TEMPLATE_CLONE — phrasing nearly identical to another review

> "Fast service, professional staff, highly recommend to everyone."
> "Fast service, professional team, highly recommend to all."
> "Fast diagnosis, professional approach, recommend without hesitation."
> "Quick service, friendly staff, would recommend to anyone."
> "Professional service, fast turnaround, definitely recommend."

