### EDITED_REVIEW — review was modified after posting (real signal)

> Updated 3 days later to add specific details about a warranty issue that was resolved.
> Original: "Good service." → Edited to include: "They replaced the clutch, took 4 hours as promised, cost 1200 PLN."
> Edited to correct the waiting time from "2 hours" to "90 minutes" after checking the receipt.
> Added a follow-up note 2 weeks later: "The repair held up perfectly, no issues."
> Correction posted: "I said the price was 500 but it was actually 450 — my mistake."

