### HAS_PHOTOS — review includes attached photos (real signal)

> A photo of the repaired part with a receipt visible in the background.
> Before/after photos of the bodywork repair.
> A photo of the waiting area showing the actual space.
> Photo of the invoice with the repair description visible.
> Dashboard photo showing the warning light was off after the repair.

