### HELPFUL_VOTES — other users marked the review as helpful (real signal)

> Review has 14 helpful votes — other users found the detailed description useful.
> 7 people marked this review as helpful, suggesting the content resonated with readers.
> 3 helpful votes on a review describing a specific pricing dispute and its resolution.
> 22 helpful votes — the reviewer posted detailed photos and a cost breakdown.
> 9 helpful votes on a review that warned about a known issue with parking access.
